WEBVTT

00:00:02.138 --> 00:00:11.145
Outline proposes chapter headings for a topic, with the sources behind each part.

00:00:11.195 --> 00:00:18.884
The demo model is a stand-in with a canned answer, so look at the numbers, not the prose.

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:29.672
Draft writes a section from your library. Notes steer what it must include.

00:00:29.722 --> 00:00:37.746
Every citation in a draft is verified the same way, and you can download the result as Markdown.
